    "detailed_description": "Get ready to experience the thrill of mowing a lawn like never before!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/129ffcac45ceec2f07cd467d4b5785e3.poster.avif?t=1680257392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/129ffcac45ceec2f07cd467d4b5785e3.webm?t=1680257392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/129ffcac45ceec2f07cd467d4b5785e3.mp4?t=1680257392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In Robot Lawn Mower, you will control a robotic lawn mower as it navigates through a variety of different lawn mowing scenarios. From small residential lawns to large commercial properties, you'll encounter a wide range of obstacles and challenges that will put your skills to the test.<br><br>The game features stunning 3D graphics and realistic sound effects that will make you feel like you're really out in the yard mowing the lawn. You'll need to use your strategic thinking and quick reflexes to avoid obstacles, navigate tight spaces, and get the job done efficiently.<br><br>With multiple varied levels there's always a new challenge waiting for you. Whether you're a seasoned lawn mowing pro or a newbie just starting out, this game is perfect for anyone who loves a good challenge and wants to have some fun in the virtual outdoors.<br><br>So why wait? Download Robot Lawn Mower today and start mowing your way to victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/9f3549b5d176d56620d3f05f1ea74c9f.poster.avif?t=1680257392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/9f3549b5d176d56620d3f05f1ea74c9f.webm?t=1680257392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/9f3549b5d176d56620d3f05f1ea74c9f.mp4?t=1680257392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>\u2022 Real time grass cutting mechanics<br>\u2022 Relaxing, satisfying and calming gameplay<br>\u2022 Multiple levels<br>\u2022 Multiple robot lawn mowers to unlock<br>\u2022 Pets and other obstacles to avoid<br>\u2022 Complete challenges to unlock new robot lawn mowers<br>\u2022 Chilled out lofi music to mow to<br>\u2022 Easy to use controls<br>\u2022 Rebindable keys",
