5f1ea74c9f.webm?t=1680257392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360700/extras/9f3549b5d176d56620d3f05f1ea74c9f.mp4?t=1680257392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>\u2022 Real time grass cutting mechanics<br>\u2022 Relaxing, satisfying and calming gameplay<br>\u2022 Multiple levels<br>\u2022 Multiple robot lawn mowers to unlock<br>\u2022 Pets and other obstacles to avoid<br>\u2022 Complete challenges to unlock new robot lawn mowers<br>\u2022 Chilled out lofi music to mow to<br>\u2022 Easy to use controls<br>\u2022 Rebindable keys",
